## ruling F: --namedstyles-sample, --read-sample and --roundtrip-sample rerun on the corpus, both targets, each line compared field by field with the earlier run's (specs/0042 "Planning rulings during P1", ruling F; change NZN)
command: the tool_args column of <corpus>/runs/<earlier run>/run.host.tsv and run.i686.tsv, for each sample's earlier run
  namedstyles: 2026-10-12-6f51899-namedstyles: tool_args host [--namedstyles-sample], i686 [--namedstyles-sample]
